<h2>The Generated Email</h2>

<p>
    The email request includes:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Professional subject line</strong> – "Loss Run Request - [Client Name] - [Line of Business] ([Policy Number])"</li>
    <li><strong>Clear request</strong> – States what you're requesting and for which client</li>
    <li><strong>Policy details table</strong> – Organized table showing:
        <ul>
            <li>Policy Number</li>
            <li>Effective Date</li>
            <li>Expiration Date</li>
            <li>Carrier</li>
            <li>Wholesaler (if applicable)</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><strong>Polite closing</strong> – Professional thank you message</li>
</ul>

<p>
    The email is formatted in HTML, making it easy to read and professional-looking.
</p>

