<h2>Using Send All</h2>

<p>
    The "Send All" feature allows you to:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Request from all carriers at once</strong> – Send loss run requests to every carrier in the list</li>
    <li><strong>Save time</strong> – Avoid clicking "Send Email" for each carrier individually</li>
    <li><strong>Ensure completeness</strong> – Make sure you don't miss any carriers</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <strong>How it works:</strong>
</p>

<ol>
    <li>Click "Send All" at the top of the utility</li>
    <li>Quickfire will attempt to send emails to all carriers that have email addresses configured</li>
    <li>For carriers without email addresses, you'll see which ones need manual contact</li>
    <li>Review the results to see which requests were sent successfully</li>
</ol>

<p>
    <strong>Note:</strong> "Send All" only sends emails. For carriers that require portal access or phone contact, you'll need to handle those separately.
</p>

