<h2>Best Practices</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Request early</strong> – Request loss runs well in advance of renewal deadlines (60-90 days before)</li>
    <li><strong>Be specific</strong> – Include all policy numbers and dates to avoid confusion</li>
    <li><strong>Follow up</strong> – Track which carriers you've contacted and follow up if needed</li>
    <li><strong>Use the right method</strong> – Some carriers prefer email, others prefer portals</li>
    <li><strong>Keep records</strong> – Note when you sent requests and when you received responses</li>
    <li><strong>Customize when needed</strong> – Use "Fallback Email" if you need to add special instructions</li>
</ul>

