<h2>When to Use This Utility</h2>

<p>
    Use the Request Loss Runs utility when:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Preparing for renewals</strong> – Gathering loss history before renewal discussions</li>
    <li><strong>Submitting to new carriers</strong> – Providing loss runs as part of new submissions</li>
    <li><strong>Client requests</strong> – When clients need updated loss history</li>
    <li><strong>Underwriting requirements</strong> – When carriers require current loss runs</li>
    <li><strong>Multiple carriers</strong> – When you need to request from several carriers at once</li>
</ul>

